From aa4d0288767576635eedebd3b8cdd90bc8a5feaa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Rene=20Sch=C3=B6nfelder?= <rene.schoenfelder@tum.de>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 09:19:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(composer): gate authenticated inference on model and
 proxy readiness
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Keep model health checks on the model container and probe the OAuth listener independently. Knative multi-container probing must observe both before admitting serving traffic, including cold starts. Add native readiness regression coverage and preserve public serving behavior.

Signed-off-by: Rene Schönfelder <rene.schoenfelder@tum.de>
